    {
      "text": "if man boasts in own strength, he must fall, D&C 3:4. love and serve God with all your heart, might, mind, and strength, D&C 4:2 (59:5). do not run faster or labor more than you have strength, D&C 10:4. keep commandments with all your strength, D&C 11:20. earth shall bring forth in its strength, D&C 59:3. turn to God with all your might, mind, and strength, D&C 98:47. stakes are for curtains or strength of Zion, D&C 101:21. strength of the Lord’s house, D&C 105:16. Zion to put on her strength, D&C 113:8.",
